  "_comment": "Crop database (v2, 2026-10-07). Loaded by scripts/crop_db.gd. stage_days[i] = days a plant spends in growth stage i before moving on; a crop is mature once it has grown sum(stage_days) watered days, so it shows len(stage_days)+1 sprites (stage_0 = freshly planted ... stage_N = mature). An unwatered day pauses growth; it never kills the plant. regrow_days > 0 means harvesting leaves the plant in place and it fruits again after that many watered days. seasons lists when it can grow; on the first day of a season it can't grow in, it withers. yield_min/max plus extra_chance (an independent chance of +1) decide the harvest count. form drives the procedural art generator (tools/art/items) and has no gameplay effect. growth_stages is derived (= len(stage_days)+1) and kept for older callers.",

